      "extract": "Now we can deﬁne functionals for knots as follows. Let Nε(K) be an ε-tubular neighbourhood of K. Expand Erλ(∂Nε(K)) and Erλ′(Nε(K)) in series of ε. We conjecture that functionals that can capture global properties of knots appear as a coeﬃcient of ε2-term of Erλ(∂Nε(K)) and as a coeﬃcient of ε4-term of Erλ′(Nε(K)). When K◦is a round circle with radius 1, our main theorem implies Er−4(∂Nε(K◦)) = π3ε 2 √ 1 −ε2 \u00123 log",
